[{"title":"赠周二仔入京","author":"陈献章","text":"故人讶我久无书，只到长安梦亦疏。\n万里周郎知此意，杖藜江上送长须。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"天边暝色将秋至，海上长风送月来。\n何处无人识东所，夜分楼上了馀杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"明月清风放两头，一筇挑到古尼丘。\n而今老去无筋力，独坐江槎看水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"扳缘千尺采松花，服食为仙未到家。\n我得丹方欲传与，肯捐妻子入烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"路自飞云过阆壶，仙人迓我久趑趄。\n相期汗漫归何处，独占烟波理钓鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"放倒琼林半醉间，半留醒处著江山。\n病来只有冠裳在，不带朱门一事还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"不求老马在长途，谁道长安一马无。\n伯乐未来忧蓟北，凭君传语到平湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其七","author":"陈献章","text":"邯郸枕上看三台，谁撼藜床唤老来。\n幽事不应全废却，夜来风吼涧中雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其八","author":"陈献章","text":"西风吹老木兰花，水阁氛氲带晚霞。\n溪上行人不相识，隔船对语问谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41964,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其九","author":"陈献章","text":"海上峰峦今属谁，携来四百布囊垂。\n或嫌珠佩多遗恨，化作长髯未可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张廷实东所寄兴见寄 其十","author":"陈献章","text":"门下诸生无一个，山童撤却皋皮坐。\n与侬七尺青团蒲，今年换与张东所。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沽酒","author":"陈献章","text":"酒店无钱与酒迟，初晴天气菊残时。\n乾坤不放閒人醉，也到江门酒盏知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南浦送别图为蒋方伯","author":"陈献章","text":"何人更卖云卿屦，我昔曾过孺子亭。\n欲写别离非此日，西山南浦认丹青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"花开无酒醉江滨，莫笑人间破葛巾。\n庐阜长官归未得，看花还共去年人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"餐香谁亦到湘滨，西崦东篱滥一巾。\n去岁金英曾照我，今年玉蕊又惊人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"白雁南飞到海滨，吟边芳气袭衣巾。\n门通水竹三丫路，坐对求羊一辈人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"秋英如雪照江滨，扳折须防小侍巾。\n曲槛两头门尽掩，先生元是惜花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"日日狂歌菊涧滨，花神应识玉台巾。\n西风为扫繁华去，不遣红芳近老人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"花舫谁撑绿渚滨，道人醉脱碧方巾。\n东篱不饮江州酒，彭泽当年未尽人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其七","author":"陈献章","text":"精魄当归楚水滨，天涯闻讣忽沾巾。\n西风吹醒蒲团梦，独对黄花忆故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其八","author":"陈献章","text":"扁舟何处剡溪滨，夜半归来雪满巾。\n争似一瓢秋菊伴，漆园风暖蝶疑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其九","author":"陈献章","text":"我貌不如苏颍滨，秋风华发已盈巾。\n有钱不买重阳醉，篱下黄花也笑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其十","author":"陈献章","text":"菊坡持酒越江滨，御笔亲题与醉巾。\n丞相九回徵不起，碧虚长揖梦中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其十一","author":"陈献章","text":"知章投老鉴湖滨，还戴华阳羽士巾。\n元亮也归三径去，至今人笑是痴人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊 其十二","author":"陈献章","text":"陶家园里旧开丛，复入山窗对此翁。\n一曲一杯花下醉，人生能得几回逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种扶留用旧韵 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"轻落藤梢浅打沟，种时须共小迟留。\n浮生日月供眠外，付与携锄抱瓮休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种扶留用旧韵 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"絜矩工夫但一沟，山中夜雨长扶留。\n莫教看到诗人眼，千首鸢鱼也未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"陈献章","text":"娉婷郑女著纤罗，能为襄王激楚歌。\n一曲霓裳都扫尽，尊前无地舞阳阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠麦岐出游 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"错教人意向花浓，万树香飘一夜风。\n行过东津莫回首，一番春事又成空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠麦岐出游 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"我得无言赠麦岐，乾坤游走到何时。\n千山万水无穷意，分付芙蓉杖一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月八夜忽梦玉宇无瑕碧云灿烂南斗下大书八字云生生生德俊逸超全下有四人面西而行或隐或见觉后纪以绝句","author":"陈献章","text":"八字光腾斗外天，碧云西去拥群仙。\n乾坤此梦无人话，起步中庭月上弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人","author":"陈献章","text":"谁将儿女浪干情，春雨来时草又生。\n梦亦是真真亦梦，石泉槐火对清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼周镐 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"一封长夏寄京书，不遣归来待拜除。\n谁与行人报消息，高堂今日要人扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼周镐 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"一双玉树出东溟，岂意先随晓露倾。\n三十六年惟一女，老夫垂泪写铭旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼周镐 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"叔子还家定买碑，墓旁将刻老夫诗。\n诗中不借閒言语，只写人间母子悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼周镐 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"嗜好平生法帖诗，偶逢方士问刀圭。\n何人摆脱浮生事，得似周郎易箦时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望白龙池 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"西望不见昆崙池，白龙上天归何时。\n望中心逐飞云去，半挂玉台松树枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望白龙池 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"涵虚数尺镜光悬，旧是头陀洗钵泉。\n又有山人来洗耳，白龙休占水中眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望白龙池 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"云影天光共一池，池中消长白龙知。\n仙翁骑龙上天去，只有明月照涟漪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"一枝低压坞篱斜，细路穿云竹半遮。\n忽被暗香相引去，小塘诗景在西家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"老树眠江水齧之，茫茫水月浸花枝。\n暗香捲入沧溟去，不是渔翁那得知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"沙笼寒月树笼烟，香彻龙溪水底天。\n斜隔竹林窥未得，更寻西路上渔船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"南枝照水忽先开，渔父湾头有钓台。\n罢钓归来溪路暝，暗香几度倩风媒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"孤山山下一枝梅，春到南枝尚未开。\n酒醒西楼看月坐，清风湖上捲香来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"朝来溪上弄花丸，天地氤氲日月还。\n无觅暗香疏影处，笑呼欧九问孤山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其七","author":"陈献章","text":"梅花撩我又冬残，落日深山一凭阑。\n病眼不知花妙处，只将花作野人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其八","author":"陈献章","text":"梅花如雪拥溪扉，渔父村南负酒归。\n纵饮不知花落去，酒醒船上见花稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其九","author":"陈献章","text":"日日花边唤酒船，梅花开处酒家眠。\n青山一片无人买，谁与先生办酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其十","author":"陈献章","text":"樵客入林闻曙鸦，梅梢残月暗溪沙。\n沿溪路尽无人到，更说林逋住处赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其十一","author":"陈献章","text":"舍南朝见一枝梅，舍北桃花昨夜开。\n笑问花开何太急，青春肯逐酒钱来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provena