39194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜黄在登科 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"半醒半醉一儒巾，黄卷青灯二十春。\n晚醉鹿鸣君莫讶，龙头还属老成人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜黄在登科 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"龙头还属老成人，夜半雷声己变春。\n莫为晨昏留不去，安车扶上白头亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜黄在登科 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"安车扶上白头亲，徐积当年也为贫。\n忆昨扁舟淮上路，青山吾拜墓中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松雪图","author":"陈献章","text":"元时有个赵松雪，松雪于今又属谁。\n一幅丹青一瓢酒，廖公来乞老夫诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]